⁕ Welcome to Epilog

Epilog is set up. Each day at {{ digest_time }} it'll email you what the accounts you follow posted on Instagram.

Reply to this email with the accounts you want to follow, one per line:

  @yourfavoritebakery
  @a.local.gallery
  @that.record.shop

You'll get a confirmation within about 15 minutes, followed by a first digest of their posts from the past week.

Which accounts work? Business and Creator accounts, which covers most brands, shops, artists, musicians and publications. Instagram's API doesn't allow reading personal accounts; Epilog will tell you if any you send are personal.

Changing your list later: reply to any digest with more handles, or "remove @handle".

Epilog is a free, open-source project using Instagram's official API: https://karavaldon.com/epilog
